    "evidence/raw/turn35_w41/EV-443_clan_gem_economy.html",
    "CLAN GEM ECONOMY: a detailed calculation post itemises a full season as DLL 6,000 (1.64M XP/1,000), Progression Bank 1,640, DLL Leaderboard 100, DLL Challenges 180, Season Pass 300 (20+25+10+30+40+125+50), Daily+Weekly Challenges 897, Clans 275, DP Points Ladder 215. The CLAN 275 = 25 gems + 150 gems for 10M clan points = 175 from the ladder PLUS 100 for being number one in-clan - which CONTRADICTS the 50-gem figure in the Spanish clan-leader thread, so C-017 stays OPEN but leans to 100. Clan season lasts 10 days; final DP ladder gem reward needs ~145,000 DP with a Tier 1 win worth ~300 DP under a Legendary boost. DLL pays gems for a season finish with a MINIMUM OF 14 POINTS. Clan recruitment norms: [AAA] at 11.7M requires 350K+ every season or removal; players advertise 150k-350k; leaders kick sub-20k contributors in their first hour; clan targets of 7.5M, 8M and 10M are common",
