add_claim("A detailed community calculation itemises a full season's gem economy: DLL 6,000, Progression Bank 1,640, DLL Leaderboard 100, DLL Challenges 180, Season Pass 300, Daily+Weekly Challenges 897, Clans 275, DP Points Ladder 215.", 3, "economy/full-season-gem-ledger", [e_cg])
add_claim("The clan component of the season gem ledger is 275 gems: 25 plus 150 for reaching 10,000,000 Clan Points on the reward ladder (175 total) PLUS 100 gems for being number one on the in-clan leaderboard.", 3, "clans/gem-ledger-breakdown", [e_cg], notes="Supports the 100-gem figure in C-017")
add_claim("Season Pass gem rewards are itemised as 20+25+10+30+40+125+50 = 300 gems across the ladder.", 3, "economy/season-pass-gem-items", [e_cg])
add_claim("The final DP ladder gem reward needs about 145,000 Dream Points, with a Tier 1 win worth roughly 300 DP under a Legendary points boost.", 3, "prizeladder/final-gem-reward-145k", [e_cg])
add_claim("The clan season lasts 10 days, consistent with the Progression Bank season length.", 3, "clans/season-10-days", [e_cg])
